prefix detroit https://detroitmi.gov/zoning/
class Applicant
class RegulatedUseApplication
class Property
class DelinquentObligation
class BlightViolation
class RegulatedUseSite
class SpacingWaiver
property filed_by domain RegulatedUseApplication range Applicant min 1 max 1
property concerns_property domain RegulatedUseApplication range Property min 1 max 1
property delinquent_on domain Applicant range DelinquentObligation
property obligation_from domain DelinquentObligation range BlightViolation min 1 max 1
property acquired_by_foreclosure_or_deed_in_lieu domain Applicant range Property
property authorization_corrects domain RegulatedUseApplication range BlightViolation
property waiver_for domain SpacingWaiver range RegulatedUseApplication
datatype boundary_distance_to domain RegulatedUseApplication target RegulatedUseSite range Length
predicate legally_established domain RegulatedUseSite
